{start_of_verse}
I said, [D]Go if you wanna go,_[A/D][D] stay if you want to stay_[A/D][D]
I didn’t [F#m7]care if you hung around me, I didn’t c[Bm7]are if you went away
[D]I know you were never right,_[A/D][D] I’ll admit I was never wrong [A/D][D]
I could [F#m7]never make up my mind, I made it u[Bm7]p as I went along
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_part: Bridge}
And though I [G]treated you like a [D/A]child,
I’m gonna [G/B]miss you for the rest of my l[D]ife..[A/B].
{end_of_part}

{start_of_chorus}
[A]All I need is a [D/F#]miracle, All I[A/E] need is y[D]ou
