[A]All I need is a [D/F#]miracle, All I[A/E] need is y[D]ou_[G/A]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse}
I [E]never had any time,_[B/E][E] and I never had any call_[B/E][E]
But I went [G#m7]out of my way just to hurt you, the on[C#m7]e I shouldn’t hurt at all
I [E]thought I was bein’ cool,_[B/E][E] yeah I thought I was bein’ strong [B/E][E]
But it’s [G#m7]always the same old story, you never kn[C#m7]ow what you’ve got ’til it’s gone
{end_of_verse}

